["Requires all 3 key fragments and Old Hillsbrad access."]="Requer os 3 fragmentos de chave e acesso ao Antigo Contraforte de Eira dos Montes.",
["Requires both first-pair Illidari-Bane tasks: Fresh from the Mechanar and The Lexicon Demonica."]="Requer as duas primeiras tarefas Illidari-Bane: Fresh from the Mecanar e The Lexicon Demonica.",
