["Repeatable hand-in; not a daily. Warrior/paladin weapon use. Plant Unfired Ancient Blade for Onyxia's frontal flame, pick up Heated Ancient Blade, then use it on her corpse within its time limit. Return Treated Ancient Blade to Lydros in the Athenaeum."]="可重复上交；非每日任务。战士/圣骑士武器用途。放置Unfired Ancient Blade以承受奥妮克希亚的正面火焰，拾取Heated Ancient Blade，然后在时限内对她的尸体使用。将Treated Ancient Blade交还给Athenaeum中的莱德罗斯。",
