["Requires Exalted with Brood of Nozdormu. Final Exalted Brood of Nozdormu ring for this path. Earlier Neutral/Friendly/Honored/Revered rings are in the chain. Choose one path; each upgrade consumes the preceding ring. The Changing of Paths quests are separate Exalted exchanges."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣崇拜声望。此路线的最终崇拜级诺兹多姆的子嗣戒指。之前的中立/友善/尊敬/崇敬戒指均在任务链中。选择一条路线；每次升级都会消耗前一枚戒指。The Changing of Paths任务是单独的崇拜级兑换。",
