["Requires Leatherworking 300. Leatherworking 300 only. Teaches crafting of Onyxia Scale Cloak (learned directly from this quest). The epic jewelry reward is on Celebrating Good Times."]="需要制皮技能300。仅限制皮技能300。教授制作Onyxia Scale Cloak（直接通过此任务学会）。史诗首饰奖励在Celebrating Good Times任务中。",
["Requires Leatherworking 300. Leatherworking 300 only. Teaches crafting of Onyxia Scale Cloak (learned directly from this quest). The epic jewelry reward is on For All To See."]="需要制皮技能300。仅限制皮技能300。教授制作Onyxia Scale Cloak（直接通过此任务学会）。史诗首饰奖励在For All To See任务中。",
["Requires Library, Armory and Cathedral. The Scarlet Key comes from Doan's Strongbox in Library."]="需要完成图书馆、军械库和大教堂。Scarlet Key来自图书馆中的Doan's Strongbox。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣中立声望。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu. ALL required before this step: The Wrath of Neptulon; Nefarius's Corruption; The Champion Returns. Their branches may be completed in parallel."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣中立声望。此步骤前需全部完成：The Wrath of Neptulon；Nefarius's Corruption；The Champion Returns。这些分支可以同时进行。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu. Blue scepter-shard branch. Assemble the eight chapters with Magical Book Binding. Chapters come from Doctor Weavil on Alcaz Island, Blasted Lands demons, Winterspring Hederine demons, Undercity, Stormwind, Onyxia, Blackwing Lair and Ragnaros. The Ragnaros chapter requires reaching and killing him within two hours of entering Molten Core; accept the quest before starting the raid. This book task is parallel to Narain's goggles and chicken tasks."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣中立声望。蓝色权杖碎片分支。用Magical Book Binding装订八个章节。章节来自奥卡兹岛的维维尔博士、诅咒之地的恶魔、冬泉谷的海德琳恶魔、幽暗城、暴风城、奥妮克希亚、黑翼之巢和拉格纳罗斯。拉格纳罗斯的章节要求在进入熔火之心后两小时内到达并击杀他；请在开始团队副本前接受任务。此书籍任务与纳瑞安的护目镜和小鸡任务同时进行。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu. Blue scepter-shard branch: finish ALL THREE Narain tasks (goggles, chicken, and Draconic for Dummies), then supply the buoy materials. This is not a Blackwing Lair attunement. ALL required before this step: Scrying Goggles? No Problem!; Return to Narain; The Only Prescription. Their branches may be completed in parallel."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣中立声望。蓝色权杖碎片分支：完成纳瑞安的全部三个任务（护目镜、小鸡和Draconic for Dummies），然后提供浮标材料。这不是黑翼之巢的进入任务。此步骤前需全部完成：Scrying Goggles? No Problem!；Return to Narain；The Only Prescription。这些分支可以同时进行。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu. Final weapon choice of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands storyline. All three dragonflight branches feed The Might of Kalimdor. Jonathan is an AQ opening-event NPC; availability depends on the realm event. The raid does not require this chain once the gates are open."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣中立声望。流沙节杖剧情的最终武器选择。三条龙族分支均通往The Might of Kalimdor。乔纳森是AQ开门事件的NPC；能否接取取决于服务器的事件进度。大门开启后，团队副本不再需要此任务链。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu. Historical AQ opening-event quest. The Black Qiraji Resonating Crystal is only awarded by ringing the Scarab Gong during the original server opening window (opening plus ten hours). It cannot be obtained from this quest after that event has ended. This is not required to enter an already-open AQ raid."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣中立声望。历史上的AQ开门事件任务。Black Qiraji Resonating Crystal只能在服务器最初的开门时段（开门后十小时内）敲响甲虫之锣获得。该事件结束后无法再通过此任务获得。进入已开放的AQ团队副本不需要此任务。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu. Red scepter-shard branch. Pick up from Vaelastrasz before engaging him. Kill Nefarian and loot Red Scepter Shard within the quest's five-hour timer. The blue and green shard branches are parallel requirements for The Might of Kalimdor, not sequential prerequisites to this quest."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣中立声望。红色权杖碎片分支。在与瓦拉斯塔兹交战前接取任务。在任务的五小时计时内击杀奈法利安并拾取Red Scepter Shard。蓝色和绿色碎片分支是The Might of Kalimdor的并行要求，而不是此任务的先后前置条件。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu. Repeatable hand-in; not a daily."]="需要诺兹多姆的子嗣中立声望。可重复上交；非每日任务。",
