["Requires the earlier Hidden Enemies chain steps in Orgrimmar. The next Hidden Enemies step later offers:"]="需要先完成奥格瑞玛中Hidden Enemies任务链的前置步骤。之后的Hidden Enemies步骤将提供：",
["Result: Hyjal Summit attunement and 3,000 Scale of the Sands reputation. Accept BEFORE killing Vashj and Kael'thas. Original rules needed Revered with Keepers of Time to accept it."]="结果：海加尔峰进入资格和3000点流沙之鳞声望。在击杀瓦丝琪和凯尔萨斯之前接受任务。最初的规则需要时光守护者崇敬声望才能接取。",
["Result: Serpentshrine Cavern attunement (no equippable cudgel). Skar'this is only in HEROIC Slave Pens, in a cage by the eastern passage after Mennu. Someone else may summon Nightbane for you."]="结果：毒蛇神殿进入资格（没有可装备的短棒）。斯卡希斯只在英雄模式奴隶围栏中，位于门努之后东侧通道旁的笼子里。其他人可以帮你召唤夜之魇。",
["Reward: 10 Badge of Justice. Starts with the Blood of Zul'jin from Zul'jin - only one drops, arrange who loots it."]="奖励：10枚公正徽章。由祖尔金掉落的Blood of Zul'jin开始——只会掉落一个，请安排好由谁拾取。",
