["Reward: Band of the Eternal Champion. Pick ONE of the four role rings; at Exalted Soridormi can swap it for another role for 75 gold."]="奖励：Band of the Eternal Champion。四个职责戒指中选择一个；崇拜时可花费75金币在索莉多米处换成其他职责的戒指。",
["Reward: Band of the Eternal Defender. Pick ONE of the four role rings; at Exalted Soridormi can swap it for another role for 75 gold."]="奖励：Band of the Eternal Defender。四个职责戒指中选择一个；崇拜时可花费75金币在索莉多米处换成其他职责的戒指。",
["Reward: Band of the Eternal Restorer. Pick ONE of the four role rings; at Exalted Soridormi can swap it for another role for 75 gold."]="奖励：Band of the Eternal Restorer。四个职责戒指中选择一个；崇拜时可花费75金币在索莉多米处换成其他职责的戒指。",
["Reward: Band of the Eternal Sage. Pick ONE of the four role rings; at Exalted Soridormi can swap it for another role for 75 gold."]="奖励：Band of the Eternal Sage。四个职责戒指中选择一个；崇拜时可花费75金币在索莉多米处换成其他职责的戒指。",
["Reward: Blessed Medallion of Karabor (Black Temple teleport). A Distraction for Akama gives the entry Medallion of Karabor - keep it for the upgrade. Raid steps: talk to Seer Olum after Karathress (SSC), kill Al'ar wearing the Ashtongue Cowl (The Eye), loot the Time-Phased Phylactery from Rage Winterchill (Hyjal). Speak to Kanai BEFORE Shade of Akama dies."]="奖励：Blessed Medallion of Karabor（黑暗神殿传送）。A Distraction for Akama奖励进入用的Medallion of Karabor——请保留它用于升级。团队副本步骤：击败卡拉瑟雷斯后与先知奥鲁姆交谈（SSC），佩戴Ashtongue Cowl击杀奥（风暴要塞），从雷基·冬寒身上拾取Time-Phased Phylactery（海加尔山）。在阿卡玛之影死亡之前与先知坎奈交谈。",
["Reward: Charmed Amani Jewel (+15 Stamina gem). Progress Budd's map and exploration first so Prigmon's quests open. Zungam is in a hut by the water near the Halazzi approach."]="奖励：Charmed Amani Jewel（+15耐力宝石）。先推进Budd的地图和探索任务，以开启普雷蒙的任务。苏加姆在哈尔拉兹通道附近水边的小屋里。",
["Reward: Phoenix-fire Band and The Tempest Key (original key for Tempest Keep: The Eye). Accept BEFORE the kill. This is kill credit; Magtheridon's Head is a separate quest."]="奖励：Phoenix-fire Band和The Tempest Key（风暴要塞的原始钥匙）。在击杀前接受任务。此任务只需击杀即可完成；玛瑟里顿的头颅是另一个独立任务。",
["Reward: The Master's Key. Take Return to Khadgar BEFORE leaving Black Morass. Steamvault and Arcatraz fragments need the following quest accepted first; normal mode is enough."]="奖励：The Master's Key。离开黑色沼泽之前接取Return to Khadgar。蒸汽地窟和禁魔监狱的碎片需要先接受后续任务；普通模式即可。",
["Reward: Violet Badge (Arcane resistance trinket). Accept A Demonic Presence BEFORE Prince dies."]="奖励：Violet Badge（奥术抗性饰品）。在玛克扎尔王子死亡之前接受A Demonic Presence。",
["Reward: Violet Signet of the Archmage. Pick ONE of the four role rings; at Exalted Leryda can swap it for another role for 75 gold."]="奖励：Violet Signet of the Archmage。四个职责戒指中选择一个；崇拜时可花费75金币在蕾尔达处换成其他职责的戒指。",
["Reward: Violet Signet of the Grand Restorer. Pick ONE of the four role rings; at Exalted Leryda can swap it for another role for 75 gold."]="奖励：Violet Signet of the Grand Restorer。四个职责戒指中选择一个；崇拜时可花费75金币在蕾尔达处换成其他职责的戒指。",
["Reward: Violet Signet of the Great Protector. Pick ONE of the four role rings; at Exalted Leryda can swap it for another role for 75 gold."]="奖励：Violet Signet of the Great Protector。四个职责戒指中选择一个；崇拜时可花费75金币在蕾尔达处换成其他职责的戒指。",
["Reward: Violet Signet of the Master Assassin. Pick ONE of the four role rings; at Exalted Leryda can swap it for another role for 75 gold."]="奖励：Violet Signet of the Master Assassin。四个职责戒指中选择一个；崇拜时可花费75金币在蕾尔达处换成其他职责的戒指。",
["Reward: choose ONE of A'dal's Signet of Defense (tank), Band of Crimson Fury (caster), Naaru Lightwarden's Band (healer) or Ring of the Recalcitrant (physical). Only one head drops - arrange who loots it."]="奖励：从A'dal's Signet of Defense（坦克）、Band of Crimson Fury（施法者）、Naaru Lightwarden's Band（治疗者）或Ring of the Recalcitrant（物理）中选择一个。只会掉落一个头颅——请安排好由谁拾取。",
["Reward: choose ONE of The Darkener's Grasp (tank), The Sun King's Talisman (caster), Telonicus's Pendant of Mayhem (physical) or Lord Sanguinar's Claim (healer). Only one sphere drops. Magisters' Terrace Kael'thas does not drop it."]="奖励：从The Darkener's Grasp（坦克）、The Sun King's Talisman（施法者）、Telonicus's Pendant of Mayhem（物理）或Lord Sanguinar's Claim（治疗者）中选择一个。只会掉落一个宝珠。魔导师平台的凯尔萨斯不会掉落它。",
