["Repeatable hand-in; not a daily. Requires Blacksmithing 300 to use Plans: Sulfuron Hammer. The quest exchanges one Sulfuron Ingot from Golemagg for those plans. Sulfuras is made by combining a crafted Sulfuron Hammer with Eye of Sulfuras from Ragnaros; there is no separate Sulfuras reward quest."]="可重複交付；非每日任務。需要鍛造 300 才能使用 Plans: Sulfuron Hammer。此任務以一個古雷曼格掉落的 Sulfuron Ingot 兌換該設計圖。薩弗拉斯是由製作的 Sulfuron Hammer 與拉格納羅斯掉落的 Eye of Sulfuras 合成；沒有單獨的薩弗拉斯獎勵任務。",
["Repeatable hand-in; not a daily. Warrior/paladin weapon use. Plant Unfired Ancient Blade for Onyxia's frontal flame, pick up Heated Ancient Blade, then use it on her corpse within its time limit. Return Treated Ancient Blade to Lydros in the Athenaeum."]="可重複交付；非每日任務。供戰士/聖騎士武器使用。放置 Unfired Ancient Blade 承受奧妮克希亞的正面火焰吐息，拾取 Heated Ancient Blade，然後在時限內對她的屍體使用。將 Treated Ancient Blade 交還給圖書館的萊德羅斯。",
["Requires Additional Materials, in parallel with Fresh from the Mechanar."]="需要「Additional Materials」，與「Fresh from the 麥克納爾」同時進行。",
["Requires Aldor/Scryer Shadowmoon demon-hunter chain after Altruis preparation."]="需要在奧翠司的準備任務之後完成奧多爾/占卜者的影月谷惡魔獵人任務鏈。",
["Requires Alliance Weaken the Ramparts (#9575)."]="需要聯盟的「Weaken the Ramparts」（#9575）。",
["Requires Artisan Riding and the full Swift Flight Form chain."]="需要專家級騎術以及完整的迅捷飛行型態任務鏈。",
["Requires BOTH Fresh from the Mechanar and The Lexicon Demonica."]="需要同時完成「Fresh from the 麥克納爾」與「The Lexicon Demonica」。",
["Requires BOTH bindings, Essence of the Firelord from Ragnaros while on this quest, and 10 Elementium Bars. Elementium Ore comes from Blackwing Lair; have a miner learn Smelt Elementium from Krixix in BWL. Turn-in summons Thunderaan in Silithus."]="需要「兩個」束縛、在此任務期間從拉格納羅斯身上取得的 火焰之王的精華，以及 10 個 Elementium Bar。Elementium Ore 來自黑翼之巢；讓一名礦工在 BWL 向 Krixix 學習 Smelt Elementium。交付後會在希利蘇斯召喚桑德蘭。",
["Requires Cipher of Damnation / The Tempest Key."]="需要「Cipher of Damnation」/「The Tempest Key」。",
["Requires Dark Tidings (#9587), from Vazruden's letter."]="需要「Dark Tidings」（#9587），來自維斯路登的信件。",
["Requires Dark Tidings (#9588), from Vazruden's letter."]="需要「Dark Tidings」（#9588），來自維斯路登的信件。",
["Requires Entry Into Karazhan; open arcane containers and kill the spawned guardians."]="需要「Entry Into 卡拉贊」；打開秘法容器並擊殺出現的守護者。",
["Requires Exalted with Argent Dawn."]="需要銀色黎明崇拜聲望。",
["Requires Exalted with Argent Dawn. EXALTED alternative: free Arcane Cloaking, with no materials or gold. Complete only one reputation-based attunement."]="需要銀色黎明崇拜聲望。「崇拜」替代方案：免費取得 Arcane Cloaking，無需材料或金幣。只需完成一個依聲望而定的進入資格任務。",
["Requires Exalted with Brood of Nozdormu. Final Exalted Brood of Nozdormu ring for this path. Earlier Neutral/Friendly/Honored/Revered rings are in the chain. Choose one path; each upgrade consumes the preceding ring. The Changing of Paths quests are separate Exalted exchanges."]="需要諾茲多姆的子嗣崇拜聲望。此路線最終的崇拜級諾茲多姆的子嗣戒指。較早的中立/友好/尊敬/崇敬戒指都在任務鏈中。選擇一條路線；每次升級都會消耗前一枚戒指。「The Changing of Paths」任務是獨立的崇拜級兌換。",
["Requires Exalted with Brood of Nozdormu. Repeatable hand-in; not a daily. Exalted-only path reset. Surrender the ring and the listed scarabs to abandon this path, then begin a different ring path with Anachronos. This is not another automatic ring upgrade."]="需要諾茲多姆的子嗣崇拜聲望。可重複交付；非每日任務。僅限崇拜的路線重置。交出戒指和列出的聖甲蟲以放棄此路線，然後向安納克羅斯開始另一條戒指路線。這不是另一次自動戒指升級。",
["Requires Exalted with Cenarion Circle."]="需要塞納里奧議會崇拜聲望。",
["Requires Exalted with Zandalar Tribe."]="需要贊達拉部族崇拜聲望。",
["Requires Exalted with Zandalar Tribe. Repeatable hand-in; not a daily."]="需要贊達拉部族崇拜聲望。可重複交付；非每日任務。",
["Requires Friendly reputation with Sporeggar."]="需要斯博格爾友好聲望。",
["Requires Friendly with Brood of Nozdormu."]="需要諾茲多姆的子嗣友好聲望。",
["Requires Friendly with Brood of Nozdormu. Repeatable hand-in; not a daily."]="需要諾茲多姆的子嗣友好聲望。可重複交付；非每日任務。",
["Requires Friendly with Zandalar Tribe."]="需要贊達拉部族友好聲望。",
["Requires Friendly with Zandalar Tribe. Repeatable hand-in; not a daily."]="需要贊達拉部族友好聲望。可重複交付；非每日任務。",
["Requires Honored with Argent Dawn."]="需要銀色黎明尊敬聲望。",
["Requires Honored with Argent Dawn. HONORED alternative: 5 Arcane Crystals, 2 Nexus Crystals, 1 Righteous Orb and 60 gold. Complete only one reputation-based attunement; the other versions are alternatives."]="需要銀色黎明尊敬聲望。「尊敬」替代方案：5 個 Arcane Crystal、2 個 Nexus Crystal、1 個 Righteous Orb 以及 60 金幣。只需完成一個依聲望而定的進入資格任務；其他版本為替代方案。",
["Requires Honored with Brood of Nozdormu."]="需要諾茲多姆的子嗣尊敬聲望。",
["Requires Honored with Brood of Nozdormu. Repeatable hand-in; not a daily."]="需要諾茲多姆的子嗣尊敬聲望。可重複交付；非每日任務。",
["Requires Honored with Cenarion Circle."]="需要塞納里奧議會尊敬聲望。",
["Requires Honored with Hydraxian Waterlords. Requires Honored with the Hydraxian Waterlords. This is a reputation check, not another boss kill."]="需要海達希亞水元素尊敬聲望。需要海達希亞水元素的尊敬聲望。這是聲望檢查，並非額外的首領擊殺。",
["Requires Honored with Zandalar Tribe."]="需要贊達拉部族尊敬聲望。",
["Requires Honored with Zandalar Tribe. Repeatable hand-in; not a daily."]="需要贊達拉部族尊敬聲望。可重複交付；非每日任務。",
["Requires Horde Weaken the Ramparts (#9572)."]="需要部落的「Weaken the Ramparts」（#9572）。",
["Requires How to Break Into the Arcatraz (#10704)."]="需要「How to Break Into the 亞克崔茲」（#10704）。",
["Requires Leatherworking 300. Leatherworking 300 only. Teaches crafting of Onyxia Scale Cloak (learned directly from this quest). The epic jewelry reward is on Celebrating Good Times."]="需要製皮 300。僅限製皮 300。可學會製作 Onyxia Scale Cloak（直接由此任務習得）。史詩飾品獎勵在「Celebrating Good Times」中。",
["Requires Leatherworking 300. Leatherworking 300 only. Teaches crafting of Onyxia Scale Cloak (learned directly from this quest). The epic jewelry reward is on For All To See."]="需要製皮 300。僅限製皮 300。可學會製作 Onyxia Scale Cloak（直接由此任務習得）。史詩飾品獎勵在「For All To See」中。",
["Requires Library, Armory and Cathedral. The Scarlet Key comes from Doan's Strongbox in Library."]="需要圖書館、軍械庫和大教堂。The Scarlet Key 來自圖書館中的 Doan's Strongbox。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu."]="需要諾茲多姆的子嗣中立聲望。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu. ALL required before this step: The Wrath of Neptulon; Nefarius's Corruption; The Champion Returns. Their branches may be completed in parallel."]="需要諾茲多姆的子嗣中立聲望。此步驟前需全部完成：「The Wrath of Neptulon」；「Nefarius's Corruption」；「The Champion Returns」。這些分支可同時進行。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu. Blue scepter-shard branch. Assemble the eight chapters with Magical Book Binding. Chapters come from Doctor Weavil on Alcaz Island, Blasted Lands demons, Winterspring Hederine demons, Undercity, Stormwind, Onyxia, Blackwing Lair and Ragnaros. The Ragnaros chapter requires reaching and killing him within two hours of entering Molten Core; accept the quest before starting the raid. This book task is parallel to Narain's goggles and chicken tasks."]="需要諾茲多姆的子嗣中立聲望。藍色權杖碎片分支。使用 Magical Book Binding 組合八個章節。章節來自奧卡茲島的維維爾博士、詛咒之地的惡魔、冬泉谷的 Hederine 惡魔、幽暗城、暴風城、奧妮克希亞、黑翼之巢和拉格納羅斯。拉格納羅斯的章節需要在進入熔火之心後兩小時內抵達並擊殺他；請在開始團隊副本前接受任務。此書籍任務與納里安的護目鏡和雞的任務同時進行。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu. Blue scepter-shard branch: finish ALL THREE Narain tasks (goggles, chicken, and Draconic for Dummies), then supply the buoy materials. This is not a Blackwing Lair attunement. ALL required before this step: Scrying Goggles? No Problem!; Return to Narain; The Only Prescription. Their branches may be completed in parallel."]="需要諾茲多姆的子嗣中立聲望。藍色權杖碎片分支：完成納里安的「全部三個」任務（護目鏡、雞以及「Draconic for Dummies」），然後提供浮標材料。這不是黑翼之巢的進入資格任務。此步驟前需全部完成：「Scrying Goggles? No Problem!」；「Return to Narain」；「The Only Prescription」。這些分支可同時進行。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu. Final weapon choice of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands storyline. All three dragonflight branches feed The Might of Kalimdor. Jonathan is an AQ opening-event NPC; availability depends on the realm event. The raid does not require this chain once the gates are open."]="需要諾茲多姆的子嗣中立聲望。流沙權杖劇情的最終武器選擇。三個龍族分支都通往「The Might of Kalimdor」。喬納森是 AQ 開門事件 NPC；能否接取取決於伺服器事件。大門開啟後，進入團隊副本不需要此任務鏈。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu. Historical AQ opening-event quest. The Black Qiraji Resonating Crystal is only awarded by ringing the Scarab Gong during the original server opening window (opening plus ten hours). It cannot be obtained from this quest after that event has ended. This is not required to enter an already-open AQ raid."]="需要諾茲多姆的子嗣中立聲望。舊版 AQ 開門事件任務。黑色其拉共鳴水晶只會在原本伺服器開門時段內（開門起十小時內）敲響聖甲蟲之鑼時獲得。事件結束後無法再從此任務取得。進入已開啟的 AQ 團隊副本不需要此任務。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu. Red scepter-shard branch. Pick up from Vaelastrasz before engaging him. Kill Nefarian and loot Red Scepter Shard within the quest's five-hour timer. The blue and green shard branches are parallel requirements for The Might of Kalimdor, not sequential prerequisites to this quest."]="需要諾茲多姆的子嗣中立聲望。紅色權杖碎片分支。在與瓦拉斯塔茲交戰前向他接取。在任務的五小時時限內擊殺奈法利安並拾取 Red Scepter Shard。藍色與綠色碎片分支是「The Might of Kalimdor」的平行需求，並非此任務的連續前置條件。",
["Requires Neutral with Brood of Nozdormu. Repeatable hand-in; not a daily."]="需要諾茲多姆的子嗣中立聲望。可重複交付；非每日任務。",
["Requires Orders from Lady Vashj."]="需要「瓦許女士的命令」。",
["Requires Preparing for War; not a daily."]="需要「Preparing for War」；非每日任務。",
["Requires Return to Andormu (#10285) from Old Hillsbrad."]="需要舊希爾斯布萊德丘陵的「Return to Andormu」（#10285）。",
["Requires Revered with Argent Dawn. REVERED alternative: 2 Arcane Crystals, 1 Nexus Crystal and 30 gold. Complete only one reputation-based attunement."]="需要銀色黎明崇敬聲望。「崇敬」替代方案：2 個 Arcane Crystal、1 個 Nexus Crystal 以及 30 金幣。只需完成一個依聲望而定的進入資格任務。",
["Requires Revered with Brood of Nozdormu."]="需要諾茲多姆的子嗣崇敬聲望。",
["Requires Revered with Cenarion Circle."]="需要塞納里奧議會崇敬聲望。",
["Requires Revered with Zandalar Tribe."]="需要贊達拉部族崇敬聲望。",
["Requires Revered with Zandalar Tribe. Repeatable hand-in; not a daily."]="需要贊達拉部族崇敬聲望。可重複交付；非每日任務。",
["Requires Safety Is Job One. Clear the route and Shaffar first."]="需要「Safety Is Job One」。請先清理路線並擊殺沙法爾。",
["Requires The Dark Iron War before this quest becomes available."]="需要先完成「The Dark Iron War」，此任務才會出現。",
["Requires a Reliquary of Purity; the Felvine objective is in Dire Maul East."]="需要一個 Reliquary of Purity；Felvine 目標位於厄運之槌東區。",
["Requires all 3 key fragments and Old Hillsbrad access."]="需要全部 3 個鑰匙碎片以及舊希爾斯布萊德丘陵的進入權限。",
["Requires both first-pair Illidari-Bane tasks: Fresh from the Mechanar and The Lexicon Demonica."]="需要完成第一組的兩個 Illidari-Bane 任務：「Fresh from the 麥克納爾」與「The Lexicon Demonica」。",
["Requires completed Cipher of Damnation and The Tempest Key."]="需要已完成「Cipher of Damnation」與「The Tempest Key」。",
["Requires completing Bring Me A Shrubbery!; repeatable and not a daily."]="需要完成「Bring Me A Shrubbery!」；可重複且非每日任務。",
["Requires full Vargoth staff / compendium / Keymaster route."]="需要完整的瓦戈斯法杖 / 綱要 / 鑰匙大師路線。",
["Requires raid components from Kel'Thuzad and C'Thun before the dungeon final step."]="在地城最終步驟前，需要科爾蘇加德與克蘇恩的團隊副本組件。",
["Requires the Alturus / Cedric key introduction."]="需要艾特羅斯 / 賽卓克的鑰匙入門任務。",
["Requires the Barrens oasis quest chain. Complete The Barrens Oases, The Forgotten Pools, The Stagnant Oasis and Altered Beings, then Hamuul Runetotem and Nara Wildmane before Leaders of the Fang becomes available."]="需要貧瘠之地綠洲任務鏈。依序完成「The Barrens Oases」、「遺忘之池」、「死水綠洲」和「Altered Beings」，然後完成哈繆·符文圖騰與納拉·蠻鬃的任務，「Leaders of the Fang」才會出現。",
["Requires the Consortium / Triangulation key chain."]="需要聯合團 / 三角定位鑰匙任務鏈。",
["Requires the Consortium prison-key chain and Revered reputation. This is NOT Yor's chamber."]="需要聯合團監獄鑰匙任務鏈以及崇敬聲望。這「不是」約兒的房間。",
["Requires the Defias Brotherhood escort step."]="需要迪菲亞兄弟會的護送步驟。",
["Requires the Ha'lei / Ramdor / Nitrin / Levixus chain to enable the spirit interaction."]="需要哈勒 / 藍姆多 / 奈崔恩 / 勒威薩斯任務鏈才能與靈魂互動。",
["Requires the Medivh's Journal / Nightbane summon chain and Violet Eye Honored."]="需要「Medivh's Journal」/ 夜禍召喚任務鏈以及紫羅蘭之眼尊敬聲望。",
["Requires the earlier Hidden Enemies chain steps in Orgrimmar. The next Hidden Enemies step later offers:"]="需要先完成奧格瑪中較早的「Hidden Enemies」任務鏈步驟。之後的「Hidden Enemies」步驟會提供：",
["Result: Hyjal Summit attunement and 3,000 Scale of the Sands reputation. Accept BEFORE killing Vashj and Kael'thas. Original rules needed Revered with Keepers of Time to accept it."]="結果：海加爾山進入資格與 3,000 點時光之沙聲望。務必在擊殺瓦許和凱爾薩斯「之前」接受。原始規則需要時光守望者崇敬聲望才能接取。",
["Result: Serpentshrine Cavern attunement (no equippable cudgel). Skar'this is only in HEROIC Slave Pens, in a cage by the eastern passage after Mennu. Someone else may summon Nightbane for you."]="結果：毒蛇神殿洞穴進入資格（沒有可裝備的棍棒）。司卡利斯只出現在「英雄模式」奴隸監獄，位於擊敗背叛者門努後東側通道旁的籠子裡。其他人可以替你召喚夜禍。",
["Reward: 10 Badge of Justice. Starts with the Blood of Zul'jin from Zul'jin - only one drops, arrange who loots it."]="獎勵：10 個公正徽章。由祖爾金掉落的祖爾金之血開始——只會掉落一個，請事先安排由誰拾取。",
["Reward: 5 Badge of Justice. Promises, Promises... on the way gives the 20-slot Tattered Hexcloth Sack. Budd's Map is on the GROUND at the south edge of Nalorakk's terrace. Accept Hex Lord before Malacrass dies."]="獎勵：5 個公正徽章。途中的「Promises, Promises...」會獎勵 20 格的 Tattered Hexcloth Sack。Budd's Map 位於納羅拉克平台南側邊緣的「地面上」。務必在瑪拉克雷斯死亡前接受「Hex Lord」。",
["Reward: Band of the Eternal Champion. Pick ONE of the four role rings; at Exalted Soridormi can swap it for another role for 75 gold."]="獎勵：Band of the Eternal Champion。從四種職責戒指中選擇「一枚」；崇拜時可花費 75 金幣向索芮朵蜜換成其他職責的戒指。",
["Reward: Band of the Eternal Defender. Pick ONE of the four role rings; at Exalted Soridormi can swap it for another role for 75 gold."]="獎勵：Band of the Eternal Defender。從四種職責戒指中選擇「一枚」；崇拜時可花費 75 金幣向索芮朵蜜換成其他職責的戒指。",
["Reward: Band of the Eternal Restorer. Pick ONE of the four role rings; at Exalted Soridormi can swap it for another role for 75 gold."]="獎勵：Band of the Eternal Restorer。從四種職責戒指中選擇「一枚」；崇拜時可花費 75 金幣向索芮朵蜜換成其他職責的戒指。",
["Reward: Band of the Eternal Sage. Pick ONE of the four role rings; at Exalted Soridormi can swap it for another role for 75 gold."]="獎勵：Band of the Eternal Sage。從四種職責戒指中選擇「一枚」；崇拜時可花費 75 金幣向索芮朵蜜換成其他職責的戒指。",
["Reward: Blessed Medallion of Karabor (Black Temple teleport). A Distraction for Akama gives the entry Medallion of Karabor - keep it for the upgrade. Raid steps: talk to Seer Olum after Karathress (SSC), kill Al'ar wearing the Ashtongue Cowl (The Eye), loot the Time-Phased Phylactery from Rage Winterchill (Hyjal). Speak to Kanai BEFORE Shade of Akama dies."]="獎勵：Blessed Medallion of Karabor（黑暗神廟傳送）。「A Distraction for Akama」會給予進入用的 Medallion of Karabor——請保留以便升級。團隊副本步驟：在擊敗卡拉薩瑞斯後與先知歐蘭交談（SSC），佩戴 Ashtongue Cowl 擊殺歐爾（風暴要塞），從瑞齊·凜冬身上拾取 Time-Phased Phylactery（海加爾山）。務必在阿卡瑪的黑暗面死亡「之前」與卡奈交談。",
["Reward: Charmed Amani Jewel (+15 Stamina gem). Progress Budd's map and exploration first so Prigmon's quests open. Zungam is in a hut by the water near the Halazzi approach."]="獎勵：Charmed Amani Jewel（+15 耐力寶石）。請先推進霸德的地圖和探索任務，皮格蒙的任務才會開放。祖剛在哈拉齊路線附近水邊的小屋裡。",
["Reward: Phoenix-fire Band and The Tempest Key (original key for Tempest Keep: The Eye). Accept BEFORE the kill. This is kill credit; Magtheridon's Head is a separate quest."]="獎勵：Phoenix-fire Band 和 The Tempest Key（風暴要塞的原始鑰匙）。務必在擊殺「之前」接受。這是擊殺紀錄任務；瑪瑟里頓的頭顱是另一個任務。",
["Reward: The Master's Key. Take Return to Khadgar BEFORE leaving Black Morass. Steamvault and Arcatraz fragments need the following quest accepted first; normal mode is enough."]="獎勵：The Master's Key。離開黑色沼澤「之前」務必接取「Return to Khadgar」。蒸汽洞窟和亞克崔茲的碎片需要先接取後續任務；普通模式即可。",
["Reward: Violet Badge (Arcane resistance trinket). Accept A Demonic Presence BEFORE Prince dies."]="獎勵：Violet Badge（秘法抗性飾品）。務必在莫克札王子死亡「之前」接受「A Demonic Presence」。",
["Reward: Violet Signet of the Archmage. Pick ONE of the four role rings; at Exalted Leryda can swap it for another role for 75 gold."]="獎勵：Violet Signet of the Archmage。從四種職責戒指中選擇「一枚」；崇拜時可花費 75 金幣向利瑞達換成其他職責的戒指。",
["Reward: Violet Signet of the Grand Restorer. Pick ONE of the four role rings; at Exalted Leryda can swap it for another role for 75 gold."]="獎勵：Violet Signet of the Grand Restorer。從四種職責戒指中選擇「一枚」；崇拜時可花費 75 金幣向利瑞達換成其他職責的戒指。",
["Reward: Violet Signet of the Great Protector. Pick ONE of the four role rings; at Exalted Leryda can swap it for another role for 75 gold."]="獎勵：Violet Signet of the Great Protector。從四種職責戒指中選擇「一枚」；崇拜時可花費 75 金幣向利瑞達換成其他職責的戒指。",
["Reward: Violet Signet of the Master Assassin. Pick ONE of the four role rings; at Exalted Leryda can swap it for another role for 75 gold."]="獎勵：Violet Signet of the Master Assassin。從四種職責戒指中選擇「一枚」；崇拜時可花費 75 金幣向利瑞達換成其他職責的戒指。",
["Reward: choose ONE of A'dal's Signet of Defense (tank), Band of Crimson Fury (caster), Naaru Lightwarden's Band (healer) or Ring of the Recalcitrant (physical). Only one head drops - arrange who loots it."]="獎勵：從 A'dal's Signet of Defense（坦克）、Band of Crimson Fury（施法者）、Naaru Lightwarden's Band（治療者）或 Ring of the Recalcitrant（物理）中選擇「一個」。頭顱只會掉落一個——請事先安排由誰拾取。",
["Reward: choose ONE of The Darkener's Grasp (tank), The Sun King's Talisman (caster), Telonicus's Pendant of Mayhem (physical) or Lord Sanguinar's Claim (healer). Only one sphere drops. Magisters' Terrace Kael'thas does not drop it."]="獎勵：從 The Darkener's Grasp（坦克）、The Sun King's Talisman（施法者）、Telonicus's Pendant of Mayhem（物理）或 Lord Sanguinar's Claim（治療者）中選擇「一個」。寶珠只會掉落一個。博學者殿堂的凱爾薩斯不會掉落它。",
